      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_SAINTESS_DEMON",
      "UnitMotion": "ANGRY",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "이제 어떡할 거야, 단장!",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "どうするのよ、団長！",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 4,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_SAINTESS_DEMON_09",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_SAINTESS_DEMON",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "마수라면 몰라도 공허체는 아직 무섭다구! 난이도 높아!",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "魔獣はともかく、<r=ヴォイドボーン>空虚体</r>はまだ怖いのよ！しかも強いし！",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 5,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_SAINTESS_DEMON_09",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "이 여자는 30분 전까지만 해도 <color=#F7BE45>까짓 거 식은 죽 먹기지!</color> 라고 호언장담했다.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "30分前まで、<color=#F7BE45>こんなの朝飯前よ！</color>って大口を叩いてたくせに。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
      "AutoHighlight": "OFF"
    },
    {
      "Uid": 6,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_SAINTESS_DEMON_09",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_SAINTESS_DEMON",
      "UnitMotion": "SPECIAL",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "단장이 여기까지 오자고 했으니까 책임질 거지? 응?",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "団長がここまで来ようって言ったんだから、責任取ってよ？ね？",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 7,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_SAINTESS_DEMON_09",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_SAINTESS_DEMON",
      "EmotionEffect": "EMARK",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "아냐! 역시 지금이라도 못 하겠습니다 라고 솔직하게 털어 놓자!",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "ううん！今からでも、やっぱりできませんって正直に話すのよ！",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 8,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_SAINTESS_DEMON_09",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "JumpAnchorData": [
        {
          "Uid": 1,
          "JumpAnchorStringId_KOR": "넌 끝까지 징징거리기냐?!",
          "JumpAnchorStringId_JPN": "最後まで駄々をこねるつもり！？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "Uid": 9,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_SAINTESS_DEMON_09",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
